  "prefLabel": "Hab 101.02 Absence of a Rule",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Hab 101.02 Absence of a Rule. These rules shall not limit the board's statutory duties or powers. The absence of a rule shall not limit the board's power to act pursuant to its statutory authorization.\n\nSource. #13226 eff 7-7-21",
